* text=auto eol=lf
third-party/** -text
# 原始许可按字节保留，上游换行不作为本项目的格式错误。
third-party/savage/LICENSE.html whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof
third-party/github/*LICENSE.txt whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof
# 保留随包说明的 CRLF 与原始许可末尾空行，不改写许可摘要。
third-party/VIEWER-NOTICE.md whitespace=cr-at-eol
third-party/github/NOTICE.md whitespace=cr-at-eol
third-party/runtime/ajv/LICENSE whitespace=-blank-at-eof
